{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05929","headline":"同崔傅答贤弟 · 王维","name":"同崔傅答贤弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳才子姑苏客，桂苑殊非故乡陌。\n九江枫树几回青，一片扬州五湖白。\n扬州时有下江兵，兰陵镇前吹笛声。\n夜火人归富春郭，秋风鹤唳石头城。\n周郎陆弟爲俦侣，对舞前溪歌白紵。\n曲几书留小史家，草堂棋赌山阴墅。\n衣冠若话外台臣，先数夫君席上珍。\n更闻台阁求三语，遥想风流第一人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}